Enemies in this category have a chance to create a [[Surge Attack#Death Surge|Surge]] upon death. When doing so, they have a unique death animation with a unique-looking [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] soul that spawns the surge before disappearing. All of these enemies are Aku themselves.

Notably, whenever an enemy has a non-100% chance of Death Surge, that enemy will only display this unique animation when Death Surge takes effect and instead display the default death animation when Death Surge does not take effect. This is the only way for an enemy to have more than one death animation. Currently, this only applies to [[Sinner Snache]], but also extends to all Aku enemies with this ability if the enemy base is destroyed while they are still on the field, causing them to all perish instantly and display their default death animation.

For a list of enemies that can create surges when they land an attack, see [[:Category:Surge Attack Enemies]].

